# M2: Fonts dialog on a selection, a tab stop set from the Tabs dialog, then cut, paste and undo.
@copy plain.qld
@open PLAIN.QLD
f8 right right right right right
f10 right right right right down down down down down down down enter    # Character > Fonts...
down tab bspace bspace 1 8 tab space tab space tab tab tab enter          # Arial, 18, bold, italic, OK
esc
down down home
f10 right right right right right down down down down down down down down enter   # Paragraph > Tabs...
1 period 5 tab tab down tab enter tab tab tab enter                       # a left tab with dots at 1.5, then Close
tab x                                                                      # a tab to the new stop
f10 right down down enter                                                  # Edit > Cut (no selection: nothing)
home f8 right right right right
f10 right down down enter                                                  # Edit > Cut
end f10 right down down down down enter                                    # Edit > Paste
f10 right enter                                                            # Edit > Undo
f10 down down down down down enter
n
